  "description": "Bloom Energy, IREN and ONON are tempting, but I’m watching a different group of stocks right now",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Monday! Most stocks pre-market appear to be behaving normally, no wild swings in either direction. The VIX did bounce a bit, but remains in a downtrend, for now…that is a good signal for us. </p><p>It is incredibly common that I get questions about hot stocks that ran incredibly well in the last year or two. Bloom Energy…the top performing stock of the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">StockTok Screener</a> in 2025… and others like <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$IREN&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$ONON&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>.   ALL of which have had substantial declines from their highs, down more -50%. </p><p>Are these a discount? Maybe… but we answered our own question already. They are <em><strong>actively declining, now</strong></em>. And buying NOW, would be fighting trend. So many people chant: “trend is friend” and then go on and fight the trend. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>My primary focus is on what is <em><strong>actively climbing now</strong></em>. We do not need to get best or bottom price. Just need to find an active trend, and then hang on as long as we can. We have some options here:</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/35-stocks-went-in-these-3-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">Copper Mining companies are moving upwards, </a></strong><em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/35-stocks-went-in-these-3-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">now</a></strong></em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/35-stocks-went-in-these-3-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">.</a></strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-im-more-interested-in-bitcoin?r=4z8lgl\">Gold &amp; Bitcoin is moving upwards, </a></strong><em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-im-more-interested-in-bitcoin?r=4z8lgl\">now</a></strong></em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-im-more-interested-in-bitcoin?r=4z8lgl\">.</a></strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-3-of-our-winners-yesterday-heres?r=4z8lgl\">We are late stage bull market, so my focus is on late stage assets and consolidating my portfolio, </a></strong><em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-3-of-our-winners-yesterday-heres?r=4z8lgl\">now</a></strong></em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/sold-3-of-our-winners-yesterday-heres?r=4z8lgl\">.</a></strong></p><p>Maybe this all changes in a few weeks. Maybe Bloom Energy, Iren and ON Holdings makes the most euphoric recovery…but as of today, I personally see no signs of that. And of course, if I do see the changes, I will update you! </p><p>Monday’s I usually take pretty light. I like to see how the market digests news from the weekend. Most of the news was rather mild: more strikes on Iran<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> and some talk about oil spiking<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a>…. which I consider a misleading media headline, oil continues to make lower highs and put in a low. The “oil climb” didn’t even break any prior lower highs. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!F50s!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!F50s!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!F50s!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!F50s!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!F50s!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!F50s!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png\" width=\"1397\" height=\"820\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/18bf5600-0912-4786-9b7d-f3e7b44f52e8_1397x820.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:820,&quot;width&quot;:1397,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:246791,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quo